Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:10.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望能快点孵化啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始给我买的蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,据说是幸运的蛋呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:18.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会孵出很厉害的东西的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:28.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 上啊 龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:38.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,养起来太麻烦了\n还是干脆吃了算了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:39.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是幸运之蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.12,0:00:48.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会孵出一条了不起的龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定没错！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:52.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好好好 这样啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:25.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙要…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:38.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始！\n好像孵出来了一个很小的东西！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:39.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:44.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早餐？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:48.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始你满脑子就知道吃！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,轮不到你来说我吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:13.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:25.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第5话 孵化出的东西）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:32.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这个小家伙好可爱啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:35.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还真是 蛋孵出来了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它叫龙龙哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？那是它的名字吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么看都是只雀鸟吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（雀鸟 住在山里的大型鸟类\n早上啾啾叫的就是它 大小对比）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正它很可爱 这就够了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子都喜欢可爱的东西啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:24.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（其实心里在想着过会儿要去摸摸它）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来我以前也养过宠物啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还有那闲心？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:34.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你养的是什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙？是龙对吗 阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:40.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是不知道什么时候起\n开始住在贫民区里的狗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.40,0:04:43.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙挺聪明的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:48.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我还抽空教了它不少把戏呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过有一阵子一直下雨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接不到什么委托\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:59.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,两三天都没法吃上一顿饭\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:23.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那时候多亏有它在啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:30.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你可得把那孩子盯紧了啊 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:34.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 今天吃什么好呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:47.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要努力派上用场啊 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:53.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫史莱姆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:56.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它会对声音有反应\n所以要保持安静哦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:02.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！安静点 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我都说了要安静啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个啊 阿始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:23.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:25.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看它叫声那么响\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.51,0:06:28.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看来是很害怕史莱姆啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯！好像真的是这样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 它没有生气\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:43.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始也觉得龙龙很可爱呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:50.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是在确认肉软不软吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:51.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还把手套脱了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:58.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙 你今天要负责看家\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要乖乖的噢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:09.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把眼珠子交出来！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:12.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙怕史莱姆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天就由莉露来努力啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（莉露升到了3级）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:33.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么鬼啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:45.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:50.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,靠！肉肉居然在我床上拉屎了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:53.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 这孩子的名字…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:56.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是“肉肉” 它叫“龙龙”…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:59.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？对哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙 加油！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:18.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 不可以摔倒啦 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:21.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这对龙龙来说是不是太难了呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可它要是派不上用场的话\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就会被阿始吃掉的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:30.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,以前的话另说\n现在始先生已经是了不起的冒险者了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:34.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 你应该不会做那种事了吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.77,0:08:43.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,来 加油啊！龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:45.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要注意别晃啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:47.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很棒 就是这样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:51.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要是让我来把它做成菜\n我可不愿意啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:54.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 干活去了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:56.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是村子周边的巡逻\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:09.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？出什么事了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:24.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,路上小心！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:33.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:35.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天要以莉露为榜样\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:38.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要学会工作！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会帮忙的 我们一起加油吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:49.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 老是拉屎\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样下去可是会没命的 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:02.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:11.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 又是屎吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:20.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这是兔熊的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:24.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这座山里本来是没有兔熊的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.21,0:10:29.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它要是在这里筑巢就麻烦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:32.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们循着痕迹找 莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,别走散了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,节奏都被打乱了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:46.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,像这样对折一次 再来一次\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要按照这种方法折噢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此 好！龙龙 来试试吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:00.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,对对 做得很好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错啊 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:06.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不可以！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:09.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙 你在干什么啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:15.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 重新洗一下就好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.76,0:11:19.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是兔熊吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:23.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 不过我没能找到\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:26.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,它们的繁殖力很强 还会袭击人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:28.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最好在数量增加前解决掉呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:33.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来\n兔熊为什么会出现在这附近呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:37.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟最近天冷\n山里的坚果和水果都歉收了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:42.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那它们大概是为了找食物\n特地跑过来的吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:44.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,东云先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:47.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能接下公会的正式委托\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:52.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,进行兔熊的搜索与讨伐呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:53.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,诶？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:12:02.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29岁单身中坚冒险者的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:18.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 娜塔莉？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:19.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没事啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:31.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你看嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉 你今天休息吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是工作太辛苦累着了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:37.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:40.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很快店里就要忙起来了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:43.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶快把工作完成才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:47.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 你也很清楚生病有多可怕吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:55.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那… 今天娜塔莉的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就由莉露和龙龙来完成吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:03.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:06.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但这是我的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:07.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,还是得我自己来做\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:11.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦 他们会努力完成的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:15.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是这是我的工作…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:19.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,够了！给我去休息！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:27.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你看吧 就是因为你爱逞强\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 龙龙 你要小心点哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是娜塔莉的午饭吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:14.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:16.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露给她送过去吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊 那就拜托你了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:29.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 娜塔莉打扫得干净吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 很干净哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:33.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉真了不起\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:40.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉会更努力的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:50.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,感冒的时候\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:53.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,心就会变得脆弱呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:57.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好寂寞\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:02.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:07.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你什么时候来的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:08.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚来的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:12.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 来的不是妈妈 你很寂寞吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.82,0:15:15.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是的啦 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我的妈妈三年前就已经去世了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:22.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只是感冒了 身体有点虚弱\n所以那个…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:23.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要我摸摸你的头？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的没事啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:31.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要吃奶？虽然我没有…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才不要啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.02,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 龙龙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:39.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真的谢谢你们了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:40.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:43.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,希望娜塔莉能快点好起来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:47.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且帮忙之后才发现\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.69,0:15:50.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉的工作真的很辛苦呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 虽然有时候确实很累\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:56.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想成为冒险者们的支柱\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:57.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我很享受我的工作哦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒险者的支柱？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:00.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:04.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我能为冒险者们做的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也就只是把旅馆打理得干干净净\n让他们能够好好休息而已\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为了做到这些\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:12.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我每天都得认真工作才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔莉\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:19.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你将来一定会成为一个好妻子的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么突然这么说啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:23.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:25.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你不可以做阿始的妻子噢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:40.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这下可麻烦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我明天会再去找一次试试\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不过把委托交给嗅觉灵敏的兽人族\n可能会更快一点\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也是啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.38,0:16:54.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,唉 该怎么办才好呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.93,0:16:57.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那个兔熊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:59.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很难找到吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我这些年基本都在地下城活动\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:06.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,确实没有多少\n在自然环境里追踪猎物的经验\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:11.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来阿始也会遇到困难啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:23.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 天气真好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.41,0:17:26.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你恢复精神了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:29.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 始先生 早上好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:31.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,多亏了莉露他们的帮忙\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:33.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我才能够好好地休息\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:34.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:35.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天莉露和龙龙也要一起去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我忙着找兔熊呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天你还是继续帮娜塔莉吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:46.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露作为冒险者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:49.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要做属于莉露的工作！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:52.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始和娜塔莉都在努力工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也不能输的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:00.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那你可别拖后腿啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:03.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是那只烤鸡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:08.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦！是龙龙！\n是龙龙啦 阿始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:11.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一路小心 冒险者们\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.96,0:18:13.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出发啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这道痕迹是…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,位置是不是有点太低了？\n不像是兔熊留下的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:41.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 龙龙！你要去哪儿？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:43.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快回来！龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 真吵啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有好多龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:01.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是雀鸟啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,龙龙是感觉到了同伴的气息\n所以才跑过去的吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:19.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 突然这么吵\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:38.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪儿啊 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.01,0:19:46.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是兔熊吗！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:00.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那刚才吵闹的叫声\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:06.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原来是为了获取兔熊的情报吗\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那只烤鸡…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮 龙龙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:14.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就交给莉露吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:19.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就解决了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:36.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,阿始 龙龙有派上用场吗？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:39.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 帮大忙了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雀鸟在这附近随处可见\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:45.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能从它们那儿打听到情报\n这可帮大忙了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:51.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 它真的比你还有用呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你没事吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:02.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,没事…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:05.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要努力变得比龙龙还要有用！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:08.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,让你们久等了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:11.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你这人就是废话多！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.89,0:21:15.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,打扰了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,请问这里是否有一位\n名叫维罗妮卡的女性…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:20.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,塔妮娅\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:24.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跑到这种地方来了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:26.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了一件必须告知您的事情\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:29.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事呀？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:32.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡大人的店 魅魔之翼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:34.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,已经倒闭了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.31,0:23:19.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,利夏特大人\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:32.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我要和你做个了断…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.57,0:23:33.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,维罗妮卡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:40.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回预告 决战！进攻地下城）\n
